  printf '\n'
  open_url "https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/${MANUS_SUPABASE_REF}/settings/api"
  step "Check the ref in the URL reads ${MANUS_SUPABASE_REF} before anything else."
  step "Rotate the service_role key, and the anon key."
