stage "Ticket 32: the cutover, reported and NOT performed"
say "This stage reads state and refuses to change it. Read why before"
say "deciding to override that."
printf '\n'
say "Current plan rows, read from the live database:"
printf '\n'
postgrest "plans?select=code,interval,is_active,paystack_plan_code&order=code" || warn "could not read plans"
printf '\n'
say "The cutover is THREE coupled changes, not two (ADR 0004):"
note "  1. Render's PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY and the client's public key to live"
note "  2. The live-mode Webhook URL set - done 2026-09-28"
note "  3. plans.paystack_plan_code patched to the LIVE plan codes, via"
note "     billing.updatePlan (an adminProcedure, not SQL by hand)"
printf '\n'
warn "Move 1 and 2 without 3 and installment checkouts break in"
warn "  initializeCheckout, on \"This installment plan is not configured yet.\""
warn "Move 3 early and test-mode installment work breaks instead."
printf '\n'
say "Worse than either: a Paystack plan object exists in exactly ONE mode, so"
say "the same plan has different PLN_ codes in test and live. Whichever mode's"
say "code is stored is the mode that works, and the other fails SILENTLY - a"
say "recurring charge succeeds, the webhook arrives, verifies, finds no plan"
say "and is dropped without a record. Money moves and the application says"
say "nothing. That is ticket 28's shape for the third time."
printf '\n'
note "Nothing can hit that today: both installment plans are is_active false,"
note "  so initializeCheckout refuses them on \"This access plan is not"
note "  available right now.\" - the is_active guard sits one line ABOVE the"
note "  plan-code guard and fires first - and the one-time plan never sends a"
note "  plan code at all. The hazard arrives the moment installments are"
note "  switched on."
printf '\n'
warn "This wizard will not perform the cutover, and that is deliberate."
note "  Three launch gates still sit in front of it: a live-money Paystack"
note "  test, a Render instance that does not sleep, and custom SMTP for"
note "  Auth email. Cutover also wants all three changes in one sitting,"
note "  which is a different wizard written when those gates are clear."
printf '\n'
SKIPPED+=("ticket 32: the three-part cutover - deliberately not attempted here")
pause "Continue to the summary."

